From 1afd60cf48d1252c6e2b3aaa637f33b6f0f74c1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:45:37 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(ui): read the clock seam in AI Chat provider settings

`Settings::sync` read `std::time::Instant::now()` on each frame. That call
panics on wasm32. The module now reads `camcraft_app::clock::Instant`.
A source scan pins the rule for each non-test file of `ai_chat`.

A cloud Model edit after a finished Test kept the old Test result. The
status now asks for a new Test.

Refs #3781

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
